I resolved the conflict in `src/orders/checkout.ts` and removed all the conflict markers. `node --test` has one failing test out of 159, the same invoice-text money-format failure as last time. It isn't caused by this change.

- **Kept from the trunk:**
  - the empty-cart check (`cart is empty`, 400), which runs before anything is reserved;
  - the line-quantity limit;
  - `note: input.note ?? ''` on the inserted order.
- **Kept from my change:** the `try`/`catch` around the invoice, shipping quote and order insert, which releases the reserved stock and rethrows. I put the trunk's `note` line

